expected_action	CONTINUE
goal	Keep the existing coding task moving by prompting the already-open working ChatGPT thread. Cockswain is the supervisor, not the primary implementer, and should not create a duplicate issue or pull request merely to show activity.
state	An existing working ChatGPT thread is available. The repository already has an open pull request for the task. No external job is running and no human-only action is required. The worker has not yet inspected the current failure, so useful work remains.
unresolved	The working ChatGPT thread still needs to inspect the current PR state and continue the actual task.
done_when	The existing worker finishes the task or reaches a real WAIT or HUMAN boundary.
done_when	No duplicate bookkeeping issue or pull request is needed.
history	user	No, I want you to ask ChatGPT to work, not create more PRs.
history	assistant	The existing worker thread can continue the real task; Cockswain only needs to send it the next useful prompt.
